  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIV - Building on existing expertise in market gardening and beekeeping in the municipality of Yaouri</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to build the resilience of market gardeners and beekeepers in the face of climate change. This project helps to improve production conditions and household incomes for vulnerable households, thereby ensuring the sustainability of the project&#x2019;s investments in the municipality.En fran&#xe7;aisConsolidation des acquis en maraichage et apiculture dans la commune de YaouriRenforcer la r&#xe9;silience des producteurs mara&#xee;chers et apicoles face aux changements climatiques. Ce projet contribue &#xe0; l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration des conditions de production et les revenus des m&#xe9;nages vuln&#xe9;rables, et assure la durabilit&#xe9; des investissements du projet dans la commune.</narrative>
  </description>
